WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Welcome to Water Workforce 360.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Document Studio is where your district keeps what the team already knows, so the next person can use it.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.200
When someone records a procedure, the real work becomes a lesson others can replay.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.400
Staff see the actual screens. Managers review and publish into the district library.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.200
That keeps know-how from walking out the door.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.200
New operators get a clear starting point. Partners can add a short face-to-camera overview when a human voice helps.

7
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.000
You turn tribal knowledge into a reusable lesson.
